      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLEUR BELLA (2) finished fourth from a back row draw here on Sunday and led from wider than this to win over this distance the previous time she raced here. Has the speed to take advantage of the inside draw. CAPTAIN PAPRIKA (8) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when 3 metres from the winner in third at this venue. May need some luck from the back row but two of his three career wins have come at this longer distance. PUNTO CALIENTE (3) drew on the back row and broke after copping interference so did well to place here last time, adding to a string of top-four results. Should enjoy an economical run from this better draw. Live chance. Tricky draw for THE DEVIL ROLLS ON (9) but she is ticking along well including a third here last time out.",
